<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: As the ship entered the lower orbit, something struck the hull with tremendous force. Not sure if it was the AI-core miscalculation, a terrible accident or a targeted strike, you quickly realized it doesn’t matter. You ordered your crew to get in the escape pods, but not everyone managed to get out of cryptosleep in time. The ship split into numerous chunks as it quickly descended onto the surface, and the only thing you could have done is hit the Eject button on the emergency drop pod. Perhaps some things can still be recovered from the wreckage.

Note: Since you start crash landing and with no supplies other than what you can scavenge, this is a difficult scenario.-->
  <VFEP_LowOrbitCrash.description>当飞船进入较低轨道时，有东西以巨大的力量撞击了船体。不确定这是 AI 核心的误判、可怕的事故还是有针对性的打击，你很快意识到这并不重要。你命令你的船员进入逃生舱，但并不是每个人都能及时摆脱加密睡眠。当飞船迅速降落到水面时，它分成了许多块，你唯一能做的就是按下紧急降落舱上的弹出按钮。也许仍然可以从残骸中找到一些东西。

注意：由于你开始迫降并且除了可以清理的东西之外没有任何补给，这是一个困难的场景。</VFEP_LowOrbitCrash.description>
  <!--EN: Low orbit crash-->
  <VFEP_LowOrbitCrash.label>低轨道坠毁</VFEP_LowOrbitCrash.label>
  <!--EN: A group of pirates, crash landing in the middle of nowhere. A classic VFE - Pirates experience.-->
  <VFEP_LowOrbitCrash.scenario.summary>一群海盗，迫降在荒无人烟的地方。经典的 VFE - 海盗体验。</VFEP_LowOrbitCrash.scenario.summary>
</LanguageData>
